  "implemented_result": [
    "One shared Runtime Module operation classification is consumed by Registry authoring and Execution admission.",
    "ModuleReviewer accepts exact admitted tool-free or tool-enabled capability closures without a Reviewer-specific rule.",
    "ModuleExport exposes a target-independent fixed origin bundle and keeps optional Profile and Variant records separate.",
    "Workflow is a public graph-backed authoring class over the existing WorkflowReleaseCandidate and compiler.",
    "WorkflowExport merges exact graph Module closures, de-duplicates identical releases, and excludes target-local Profile and Variant records.",
    "Workflow execution-binding content has one exact target-independent shape.",
    "The same WorkflowExport registers into multiple independent Runtime registries with independent Profile, Variant and active-pointer state."
  ],
